# PHASE 3 — REMOVE THE OLD TAX MODEL

The existing order calculation currently contains a UK-style 20% VAT assumption.

Remove that from the order total calculation.

The order calculation should conceptually become:

```text
subtotal
+ delivery fee
= total
```

Where:

```text
subtotal = sum(product final prices × quantities)
```

There must be no automatic:

```text
subtotal × 20%
```

or any other tax calculation.

Preserve authoritative server-side pricing.

The client must never be able to manipulate product prices.

