# PHASE 4 — DELIVERY MODEL

Implement delivery as an independent order amount.

For example:

```text
subtotal
deliveryFee
total
currency
```

The initial customer checkout may use:

```text
deliveryFee = 0
```

if the admin has not yet assigned a delivery charge.

But design the database/API so an authorized admin can later set the delivery fee for an order.

When delivery is changed:

```text
total = subtotal + deliveryFee
```

must be recalculated server-side.

Do not modify immutable product/order-item price snapshots.

Do not modify historical product prices.

