# PHASE 5 — PAYSTACK INTEGRATION

Implement Paystack properly.

Required architecture:

```text
Frontend
   ↓
Create order
   ↓
Backend creates pending order
   ↓
Backend initializes Paystack transaction
   ↓
Frontend receives authorization URL/reference
   ↓
Customer completes Paystack payment
   ↓
Paystack redirects customer
   ↓
Frontend displays payment status
   ↓
Backend verifies transaction with Paystack
   ↓
Backend validates:
   - reference
   - amount
   - currency
   - order
   - payment status
   ↓
Order becomes paid
```

IMPORTANT:

The frontend redirect MUST NOT be treated as proof of payment.

Payment verification must happen on the backend.

