# PHASE 8 — PAYSTACK AMOUNT VALIDATION

This is critical.

When verifying a Paystack transaction, compare the provider response against the authoritative order:

```text
provider amount
==
server order total
```

and:

```text
provider currency
==
server order currency
```

Do NOT trust:

```text
frontend amount
frontend currency
frontend payment status
```

The server must determine the amount.

Paystack should receive the server-authoritative amount.

