# PHASE 9 — WEBHOOK SUPPORT

Implement Paystack webhook handling if appropriate for the current integration.

Webhook processing must:

* verify Paystack signature
* reject invalid signatures
* be idempotent
* identify the order/payment using the provider reference
* never blindly trust the request body
* safely handle duplicate events

The webhook should be capable of confirming payment even if the customer closes the browser before returning to the site.

Do not mark an order as paid merely because a frontend callback occurred.

