# PHASE 10 — ADMIN DELIVERY UPDATE

Create the backend capability for an authenticated admin to update delivery fee on an existing order.

Requirements:

* admin authentication required
* validate amount
* prevent negative delivery fees
* preserve original product prices
* recalculate total server-side
* update the payment amount only if the order has NOT already been successfully paid
* do not silently change the amount of an already-paid transaction

If an already-paid order needs a delivery adjustment, return a clear error rather than corrupting payment history.

